/* Omnipolymath source: "Omnipolymath uses your calendars to show events and scheduling context when you enable calendar access." */
"NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription" = "O Omnipolymath usa seus calendários para mostrar eventos e o contexto da agenda quando você ativa o acesso ao calendário.";
/* Omnipolymath source: "Omnipolymath uses your calendars to show events and scheduling context when you enable calendar access." */
